{"id":"wb-5-105","name":"十二桥遗址","retrievedAt":"2026-11-06T11:54:03+00:00","status":"ready","title":"十二桥遗址","text":"十二桥遗址，位于四川省成都市青羊区十二桥路南侧，成都市文物考古研究院（原成都博物院）院内，1985－1989年发掘，为一处重要的商周时期建筑遗存。1987年1月16日公布为四川省第二批文物保护单位。2001年6月25日列为第五批全国重点文物保护单位。","shortened":false,"sourceUrl":"https://zh.wikipedia.org/wiki/%E5%8D%81%E4%BA%8C%E6%A1%A5%E9%81%97%E5%9D%80","revisionId":90277126,"revisionUrl":"https://zh.wikipedia.org/w/index.php?oldid=90277126","license":"CC BY-SA 4.0","licenseUrl":"https://creativecommons.org/licenses/by-sa/4.0/","authors":"维基百科贡献者","matchEvidence":"名称与地理坐标一致","image":{"path":"assets/wikipedia/4af897fee4cfb956bc48e9a7.jpg","title":"十二桥遗址国保碑.jpg","sourceUrl":"https://commons.wikimedia.org/wiki/File:%E5%8D%81%E4%BA%8C%E6%A1%A5%E9%81%97%E5%9D%80%E5%9B%BD%E4%BF%9D%E7%A2%91.jpg","originalUrl":"https://upload.wikimedia.org/wikipedia/commons/9/96/%E5%8D%81%E4%BA%8C%E6%A1%A5%E9%81%97%E5%9D%80%E5%9B%BD%E4%BF%9D%E7%A2%91.jpg?utm_source=commons.wikimedia.org&utm_campaign=imageinfo&utm_content=original","author":"Nekitarc","license":"CC BY-SA 4.0","licenseUrl":"https://creativecommons.org/licenses/by-sa/4.0","caption":"Shi'erqiao Site of Shang-Zhou dynasties","width":320,"height":228}}